WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:07.840
Good morning!

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.760
Just what are you up to, Kariya?

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:18.990
Whatever do you mean, Senpai?

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:22.000
In our game with Akizora Challengers...

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:27.040
You lunged into me on purpose.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:32.600
If you'd put any more force into it, you would've injured my foot.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.580
Why would you do that right before an important game?!

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:37.780
Don't falsely accuse me.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:40.300
Why did you come to Raimon?!

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.560
Are you...?!

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:48.360
If there's something you want to say, just say it.

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:52.340
Are you... a Seed?

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:53.680
Seed?

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:59.370
You're a Seed sent by Fifth Sector to mess up Raimon from within.

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:01.410
At least, that's what I think.

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:03.940
Well? Answer me!

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.610
Kirino-senpai!

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:09.960
Good morning!

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.000
Kariya, morning!

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:16.370
Hey, what's the matter? You two look pretty serious.

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:17.460
Kariya?

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:21.680
Senpai was telling me some things about Holy Road.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.950
What do I think of Kariya?

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:10.460
Have you ever met him somewhere before?

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:13.920
You think he's a Seed?

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:19.620
It's true that Kariya has a superb aptitude for soccer...

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:23.840
Enough that it wouldn't be strange for Fifth Sector to be keeping tabs on him... right?

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:27.060
But that doesn't make him a Seed.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:30.800
Kariya!

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:32.730
What's up?

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:35.260
Hey, did something happen between you and Kirino-senpai?

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:41.240
Kirino-senpai said I was a Seed.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:42.700
A Seed?!

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.800
Kirino-senpai said that?!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.620
So, what's a Seed?

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.530
You don't know?

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:56.190
Seeds are the elite who have been trained by Fifth Sector.

00:03:56.190 --> 00:04:01.130
They're first-class players with super-duper spirit, technique, physique, and they swear their allegiance to Fifth Sector.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:06.600
Kirino-senpai seems to be very hostile about Seeds...

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:10.650
Well, Raimon is stirring up a revolution against Fifth Sector.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.550
He must think the Seeds out there are trying to destroy us.

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:14.700
And I agree on that.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:21.120
Then, if I really was a Seed, what would you do, Tenma-kun?

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:25.480
Nothing, really.

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:32.280
Kariya is a member of the team now, and being a Seed doesn't necessarily make you an enemy.

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:35.750
Tsurugi was a Seed too, but now he's one of us!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:38.570
I see.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:44.260
All right, bring it!

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:45.310
Here I come!

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:48.300
You won't get past me!

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.090
Kariya!

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:53.980
It's mine!

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:06.240
Kariya!

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:08.870
What happened?

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:09.910
Kirino-senpai did it...

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:14.300
Can you stand?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:18.550
We have a match coming up, remember that.

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:21.180
There's no going back for us if he's hurt.

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:22.630
But I didn't...

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.630
Please don't blame Kirino-senpai!

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:26.810
I'm fine.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:28.850
Okay, let's resume practice!

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:36.930
Senpai, I'm totally fine, really.

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:48.990
We're on the bench for this game...

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:53.100
I thought we had a chance with Minamisawa-san gone...

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:56.330
And yet the first-years who just joined the club get to play...

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.500
Aoyama, Ichino.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.460
Don't lose focus.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.370
Trainer Kidou.

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.920
You two must be ready at all times so you can go out when necessary.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:07.940
Okay!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.920
Let's do our best, Tenma!

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:11.890
Yeah!

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:15.590
Wow, look at that!

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:23.150
So that's the Russian roulette stadium where we'll be holding the games!

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:33.460
The Holy Road that decides who's number one in jr. high soccer finally opens its Nationals tournament!

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:38.890
This tournament also bears a heavy weight on deciding the next Holy Emperor for Fifth Sector.

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:44.180
Who will ascend the Holy Emperor's throne, the current Holy Emperor Mr. Ishido Shuuji or Mr. Hibiki Seigou?

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:51.920
Now, the strong players who have won the preliminaries are gathering here at Amano Mikado Stadium in droves!

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:55.470
I, Kakuma Oushou, will bring you the commentary!

00:06:55.630 --> 00:07:10.220
Fifth! Fifth! Fifth! Fifth!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.730
Wow...

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.740
It's like they want to impress Fifth Sector's dominance on us.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:14.360
Raimon Jr. High has come here at last...

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:18.740
I only hope they won't bring ill effect to the Holy Emperor elections...

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.740
Ishido-sama, it's time.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:29.100
Now an opening statement from the tournament committee chairman, Mr. Ishido Shuuji.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:35.000
Players who have won their way to fight the Nationals...

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.030
I officially proclaim the opening of the Holy Road competition.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:43.460
The Holy Road is the epitome of soccer.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:46.420
The real fight begins now!

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:49.860
I look forward to seeing how you fare the challenges!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:55.530
Now, at last, the fierce fight begins!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:08:00.120
This year features a Russian roulette stadium, divided into five separate areas.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:04.020
Each team will hold their games on a ground chosen at random!

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:10.650
And the two schools who remain standing at the end will fight the finals here at Amano Mikado Stadium!

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:16.190
The first of these don't-miss games will begin tomorrow, each at their own Russian roulette stadium!

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:21.670
Gassan Kunimitsu...

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:23.120
It's finally tomorrow!

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.220
Yeah!

00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:32.900
This Holy Liner will take us to the grounds where we'll be playing.

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:34.360
Wow!

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:36.930
We take this to get to the grounds, huh?

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:39.380
But we don't know where it'll take us.

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:40.590
Oh yeah.

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:42.090
Anyone besides me nervous?

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.120
Who knows what sort of field we'll be fighting in.

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:48.410
It most certainly is a roulette.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:54.880
This sure is exciting!

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:55.770
Yeah!

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:02.350
Gassan Kunimitsu...

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:09.720
Minamisawa!

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:11.870
Minamisawa-san!

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:14.450
Why are you with Gassan Kunimitsu?

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:25.660
Why is Minamisawa-senpai with them?

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.020
Art thou Raimon?

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:53.950
Minamisawa-san...

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:58.190
Did you join Gassan Kunimitsu while knowing Raimon would be fighting with them?

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:02.370
I thought I'd teach you guys a lesson in reality.

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:03.730
You...

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:05.100
What are you thinking?

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.650
I don't get you!

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:10.960
You flow against a large current only to get swept under.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.650
I pity you, Raimon.

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:14.210
You bastard!

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.170
You won't get away with this!

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:16.050
Cease!

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:18.510
Who are you?

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:20.550
Hyoudou Tsukasa.

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:23.000
I serve as captain for Gassan Kunimitsu.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:27.080
Minamisawa possesses magnificent soccer senses.

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:34.520
His talents will bring further rewards to soccer for Gassan Kunimitsu, as well as for Fifth Sector.

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:38.280
And you're saying our soccer won't?

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:41.750
It's pretty clear to me which side is in the right.

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:45.240
Let's go, Minamisawa.

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:47.990
Let's each do our best.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:56.610
Are Sangoku-senpai and the others okay?

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:59.170
They've been together with Minamisawa-san all this time...

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:03.410
I know Minamisawa-san's style.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:05.260
It's gonna be so easy this way.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:05.970
But...!

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:07.970
Let's do our best!

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.890
Coach Endou!

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:16.110
That way, we'll have Minamisawa understand our soccer!

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:17.860
Okay!

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:22.300
Okay then, let's go!

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:35.000
This is...

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:39.420
The stage for Raimon versus Gassan Kunimitsu is in...

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:43.420
Cyclone Stadium!

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:46.400
What are those?

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:49.190
They're way too massive for air conditioning.

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:51.910
More like giant fans...

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:58.650
Raimon Jr. High lead by Coach Endou and Gassan Kunimitsu lead by Coach Kondou!

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.900
The game will begin momentarily!

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:03.030
Gassan Kunimitsu...

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:07.060
They're a team who clinches their wins through perfectly conducted formation changes.

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:10.870
Their coach Kondou Keiji is also a well-known tactician.

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:20.900
Once they learn of the fearsome might behind this Cyclone Stadium, Raimon Jr. High will fall.

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:24.770
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:30.310
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:34.390
Both teams are in position!

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:38.930
The match will begin with Raimon's kickoff!

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.120
Primary formation!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.140
Roger!

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:58.200
What's that?

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:00.240
Their center is wide open...

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.370
Why?

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:02.670
They're full of holes.

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:07.580
Did they have a formation in their repertoire that leaves the center open?

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:08.920
I just hope it isn't a trap.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:11.930
Let's go!

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:16.020
This is Gassan Kunimitsu's Immovable Encampment.

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:18.000
It's almost time.

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:19.650
Get in position!

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.860
What's happening?

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:40.140
What the...?!

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:44.550
Kurama-senpai!

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.000
A cyclone?!

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.050
Are you serious?

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:48.390
Kurama!

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:51.430
The cyclone swallows up Kurama!

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.810
How terrifying is the Cyclone Stadium!

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:01.510
Kurama!

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:03.060
Are you okay?

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:04.280
Yeah.

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:08.010
So that's it.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.830
The ball goes to Gassan Kunimitsu!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:15.560
Secondary formation!

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:16.660
Roger!

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:19.670
Gassan Kunimitsu changes formation!

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:30.010
Advance!

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:32.620
Gassan Kunimitsu is attacking!

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:37.160
Gassan Kunimitsu's Flame Encampment!

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:41.060
No one can stop this attack!

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:42.310
Don't let them through!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:43.340
You got it!

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:43.800
Okay!

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.150
The wind is holding us back!

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:53.660
Gassan Kunimitsu uses the giant cyclones as a shield as they approach!

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:02.450
Attack!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:03.460
Shibata!

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:05.000
Minamisawa!

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:06.170
Ichimonji!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:08.300
I'll make the first blow!

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:11.610
You're not getting through me!

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:13.060
Don't even try to intervene!

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.290
Ichimonji is getting ready to shoot!

00:15:17.090 --> 00:15:19.970
Hunter's Net!

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:25.180
Kariya blocks the shoot with his hissatsu technique!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.560
All right!

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:31.490
Nice one, Kariya!

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:33.380
We're saved.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.280
Kariya keeps the ball he's cut in his possession!

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:38.510
Impressive.

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:43.700
Kariya, pass to me!

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:44.850
Kariya!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:47.670
It's mine!

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.700
Gassan Kunimitsu makes skillful passes!

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:52.640
Minamisawa!

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.680
You make the first blow!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:58.560
Minamisawa charges to the front of the goal, unmarked!

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.110
Here it comes, Sangoku!

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:02.850
Think you can stop this?!

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:06.830
Sonic Shot!

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:09.140
Minamisawa shoots!

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:15.130
Fence Of Gaia!

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:19.490
What?!

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:23.870
Sangoku defends the goal with his hissatsu technique!

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:25.400
Sangoku...

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:26.960
Raimon dodges the danger!

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.960
All right, he stopped it!

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:35.640
The winds are dying! Let's pick up the fight while we've got a chance!

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:36.140
Okay!

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:40.260
Tertiary formation!

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:41.630
Roger!

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.720
They moved to the right this time.

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:47.810
Tenma!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.630
The ball goes from Shindou to Matsukaze!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.730
Get in position!

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:53.180
Roger!

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:07.120
How will you face down this wind?

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.060
I thought so...

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:11.700
The enemy knows the wind patterns.

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:15.730
They know at what timing the cyclones will form and what course they'll take.

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:19.570
No way... then that puts Raimon at a big disadvantage!

00:17:19.570 --> 00:17:20.970
I wouldn't say that.

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:23.470
It's coming...

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.240
I won't lose!

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:28.100
Matsukaze charges straight for the cyclone!

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:29.320
The fool!

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:30.480
Has he just given up?

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:35.320
A wind that blows me back from my destination can become a wind that pushes me forward once I ride it!

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:37.320
Soyokaze Step!

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.080
What?!

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:44.080
Good.

00:17:44.530 --> 00:17:46.200
You did it, Tenma!

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:50.580
He realized that he can use the cyclone as long as he can predict how it moves.

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:53.880
I guess only Tenma would be able to do that.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.110
His hissatsu techniques are all wind.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:59.550
Who could have imagined that Soyokaze Step could be used this way too?

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:04.960
Matsukaze breaks past the defense line!

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:08.230
That's it! Keep going!

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:09.980
You won't get past me!

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:13.250
Kurama-senpai!

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.990
The ball goes from Matsukaze to Kurama!

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:22.990
Sidewinder!

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:28.580
Kurama shoots!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:29.700
Go in!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.650
Behold my power!

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:40.370
Giant God Gigantes!

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:43.850
Gigantic Bomb!

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:56.090
Gassan Kunimitsu's captain Hyoudou Tsukasa stops the shoot with his Avatar!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:01.090
Gassan Kunimitsu's goalkeeper is an Avatar user!

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:02.540
No way...

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:02.540
So close!

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:05.120
There's trouble on top of more trouble.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:07.400
Don't worry about him, just go!

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:17.670
'Tis a fine wind.

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:21.930
He kicked the ball into the cyclone?!

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.660
Secondary formation!

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:24.260
Roger!

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:27.910
Advance!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:28.230
Roger!

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:30.980
It's no good! I can't read its course!

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.480
Which way is it headed?!

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:40.190
Gassan Kunimitsu knows how the cyclones move...

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.250
Which means...

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:45.260
Guys! Watch the other team carefully!

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:52.570
The ball will be coming... from over there!

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:55.590
God's Baton!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.630
Damn it, I can't move!

00:20:02.940 --> 00:20:04.030
I'll go!

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:06.630
Kariya, let me handle this!

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:16.610
Minamisawa!

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:20.730
Sonic Shot!

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.960
Minamisawa goes for his second shoot!

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:26.080
What?

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:28.120
Goal!

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:32.210
Gassan Kunimitsu makes the first point!

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:51.220
You can thank #15 for this point.

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.280
Kariya...

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:08.370
You were right, Kirino-senpai.

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:10.180
What?

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:12.110
I'm...

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:15.980
A Seed.

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:27.110
Kariya's provocations drive Kirino-senpai to breaking point.

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:29.450
What should we do, Coach Endou?

00:23:29.690 --> 00:23:33.720
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 The Fearsome Cyclone Stadium!

00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:36.410
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:47.850
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:56.290
A wind that blows me back from my destination can become a wind that pushes me forward once I ride it.

